+- A turn where some rounds lack usage ignores them ([validated by: skips the new usage when it is undefined](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L44)).
+- A turn with no reported usage remains `undefined` ([validated by: returns undefined when both are undefined](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L49)).
